                      (    forth6809.asm):01813         ; depth - robust regardless of whatever is already on the stack
                      (    forth6809.asm):01814         ; when this test runs. Also verifies DEPTH's own net effect
                      (    forth6809.asm):01815         ; (exactly one cell pushed) and that the three items pushed to
                      (    forth6809.asm):01816         ; set up the test are left undisturbed.
