                      (    forth6809.asm):02191         ; is popped) is copied to the top, everything beneath is
                      (    forth6809.asm):02192         ; undisturbed, and the net stack depth is unchanged (u popped,
                      (    forth6809.asm):02193         ; one copy pushed).
