                      (    forth6809.asm):06808         ; it takes a full 65536 iterations to naturally reconverge on
                      (    forth6809.asm):06809         ; equality, not one - true to the letter of "at least once" but
                      (    forth6809.asm):06810         ; impractical for a boot-time self-check. Left untested, not
