                      (    forth6809.asm):07113         ; return-stack offset once genuinely nested (J's own "8,S" -
                      (    forth6809.asm):07114         ; not the "10,S" an earlier, already-documented bug used, per
                      (    forth6809.asm):07115         ; this word's own extensive bug-fix history in the source
                      (    forth6809.asm):07116         ; itself, retraced by hand here rather than assumed still
                      (    forth6809.asm):07117         ; correct). Six (outer,inner) pairs, expected sum 63 - a wrong
                      (    forth6809.asm):07118         ; nesting depth or wrong index read would produce a different
