                      (    forth6809.asm):07641         ; immediately without ever touching CODEHERE - the error path
                      (    forth6809.asm):07642         ; never reaches any compiling code - so this needs no CODEHERE
                      (    forth6809.asm):07643         ; redirect, unlike every other test in this section. Same
                      (    forth6809.asm):07644         ; CATCH-based pattern as the divide-by-zero tests in earlier
                      (    forth6809.asm):07645         ; sections: verify the thrown code and CATCH's own depth-
                      (    forth6809.asm):07646         ; restoration contract, not the unspecified i*x values.
