                      (    forth6809.asm):07979         ; TSTCONST - unit test for CONSTANT. Compiles "5 CONSTANT
                      (    forth6809.asm):07980         ; TESTWD" (5 already pushed before CONSTANT runs, matching its
                      (    forth6809.asm):07981         ; own "x name --" signature) into scratch, then executes the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07982         ; result. Verifies it pushes the stored value (5), not its own
                      (    forth6809.asm):07983         ; address - confirmed by tracing CONSTANT's own behavior field:
                      (    forth6809.asm):07984         ; it compiles a raw address to ATSIGN (@) there directly via
                      (    forth6809.asm):07985         ; CODECOMMA, not CREATE's own placeholder mechanism.
                      (    forth6809.asm):07986         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
