                      (    forth6809.asm):08090         ; a smudged header, sets CSP to the current U as the control-
                      (    forth6809.asm):08091         ; flow balance baseline, sets STATE compiling; a literal 111 is
                      (    forth6809.asm):08092         ; compiled; SEMI compiles the closing RTS, checks the CSP
                      (    forth6809.asm):08093         ; balance, un-smudges the header, restores STATE) - then
                      (    forth6809.asm):08094         ; executes the result and verifies it pushes 111. Also verifies
                      (    forth6809.asm):08095         ; the header's own SMUDGE bit is correctly clear after SEMI -
                      (    forth6809.asm):08096         ; not just that execution happened to work.
