                      (    forth6809.asm):09212                                   ; unsafe during boot-time testing, before
                      (    forth6809.asm):09213                                   ; COLD has set it to anything meaningful. Not
                      (    forth6809.asm):09214                                   ; TSTCBUF specifically here (unlike TSTVALTO's
                      (    forth6809.asm):09215                                   ; TO-phase fix), since nothing in this phase
