                      (    forth6809.asm):09915         ; TSTCOMPCOMMA - unit test for COMPILE,. Compiles a call to
                      (    forth6809.asm):09916         ; DUP's own xt into scratch, then executes the result with a
                      (    forth6809.asm):09917         ; known value to confirm it genuinely behaves like DUP - not
                      (    forth6809.asm):09918         ; just that some bytes were written.
                      (    forth6809.asm):09919         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
