                      (    forth6809.asm):10727         ; message ("HI"), executes with a false flag, and verifies
                      (    forth6809.asm):10728         ; execution genuinely resumes right after the embedded message
                      (    forth6809.asm):10729         ; text - confirmed by hand-tracing DOABORTQUOTE's own code: on
                      (    forth6809.asm):10730         ; false, it skips past the inline message and returns normally,
                      (    forth6809.asm):10731         ; matching its own documented "on false flag: does nothing
                      (    forth6809.asm):10732         ; further".
                      (    forth6809.asm):10733         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
