                      (    forth6809.asm):18698                  ; in a new persistent flag here - GLOBALS is fully packed at
                      (    forth6809.asm):18699                  ; 256/256 bytes, and this avoids needing to carve out a byte
                      (    forth6809.asm):18700                  ; for it.
