F559 DD08             (    forth6809.asm):21116                  STD   CODEHERE   ; where WORD is about to write its parsed
                      (    forth6809.asm):21117                                   ; text. Without this, the compiled path
                      (    forth6809.asm):21118                                   ; below would compile "JSR DOSTR" (3 bytes)
                      (    forth6809.asm):21119                                   ; directly at CODEHERE - the same address
