                      (    forth6809.asm):22427                                      ; is returned by PAD") - PAD's own region,
                      (    forth6809.asm):22428                                      ; growing upward from PAD itself, distinct
                      (    forth6809.asm):22429                                      ; from HOLDMINSIZE above (which answers
                      (    forth6809.asm):22430                                      ; for a different region entirely, the
                      (    forth6809.asm):22431                                      ; downward-growing pictured-numeric buffer
                      (    forth6809.asm):22432                                      ; in the CODEHERE-to-PAD gap). PADOFFSET
                      (    forth6809.asm):22433                                      ; happens to equal PADMINSIZE numerically
                      (    forth6809.asm):22434                                      ; in this implementation (PADOFFSET EQU
                      (    forth6809.asm):22435                                      ; PADMINSIZE), but /PAD is answered with
                      (    forth6809.asm):22436                                      ; the conceptually correct constant, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):22437                                      ; the coincidentally-equal one.
FD85 FDD200070000     (    forth6809.asm):22438                  FDB   EN9,EN9L,0    ; NEW: FLOORED - previously the one item
                      (    forth6809.asm):22439                                      ; in this area explicitly left open
                      (    forth6809.asm):22440                                      ; pending its own investigation (unlike
                      (    forth6809.asm):22441                                      ; WORDLISTS, this is a CORE query, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):22442                                      ; tied to an unimplemented optional word
                      (    forth6809.asm):22443                                      ; set, so "false by omission" wasn't the
                      (    forth6809.asm):22444                                      ; right default). Investigated by tracing
                      (    forth6809.asm):22445                                      ; DIVCOMMON (shared by /, MOD, /MOD)
                      (    forth6809.asm):22446                                      ; against this system's own SM/REM and
                      (    forth6809.asm):22447                                      ; FM/MOD: DIVCOMMON restores the
                      (    forth6809.asm):22448                                      ; remainder's sign from DNSIGN (the
                      (    forth6809.asm):22449                                      ; dividend's own original sign) after
                      (    forth6809.asm):22450                                      ; dividing absolute values - exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):22451                                      ; SM/REM's own logic, confirmed identical
                      (    forth6809.asm):22452                                      ; by direct comparison. FM/MOD, by
                      (    forth6809.asm):22453                                      ; contrast, has an explicit flooring
                      (    forth6809.asm):22454                                      ; adjustment step (correcting the
                      (    forth6809.asm):22455                                      ; quotient and remainder when the
                      (    forth6809.asm):22456                                      ; quotient would be negative with a
                      (    forth6809.asm):22457                                      ; nonzero remainder) that DIVCOMMON does
                      (    forth6809.asm):22458                                      ; not have. This system's primary
                      (    forth6809.asm):22459                                      ; division words (/, MOD, /MOD) use
                      (    forth6809.asm):22460                                      ; symmetric division, not floored -
                      (    forth6809.asm):22461                                      ; FLOORED is 0 (false), a real, meaningful
                      (    forth6809.asm):22462                                      ; answer (recognized query, value false),
                      (    forth6809.asm):22463                                      ; not the "unrecognized" fallthrough
                      (    forth6809.asm):22464                                      ; WORDLISTS correctly uses.
FD8B FDD9000800FF     (    forth6809.asm):22465                  FDB   EN10,EN10L,255  ; NEW: MAX-CHAR - maximum value of any
                      (    forth6809.asm):22466                                      ; character in this implementation's
                      (    forth6809.asm):22467                                      ; character set (3.2.6). This system uses
                      (    forth6809.asm):22468                                      ; 8-bit characters throughout (matching
                      (    forth6809.asm):22469                                      ; ADDRESS-UNIT-BITS=8, already in this
                      (    forth6809.asm):22470                                      ; table) - a single byte's maximum value
                      (    forth6809.asm):22471                                      ; is 255.
FD91 FDE100120180     (    forth6809.asm):22472                  FDB   EN13,EN13L,(RSTACK-DSTACK)/2  ; NEW: RETURN-STACK-
                      (    forth6809.asm):22473                                      ; CELLS - computed from this system's own
