                      (    forth6809.asm):22475                                      ; hardcoded, so this stays correct if the
                      (    forth6809.asm):22476                                      ; memory map shifts again (it has
                      (    forth6809.asm):22477                                      ; repeatedly this session). RSTACK's own
                      (    forth6809.asm):22478                                      ; comment confirms the occupied range is
                      (    forth6809.asm):22479                                      ; $BD00-RSTACK (768 bytes currently) -
