                      (    forth6809.asm):22482                                      ; and DSTACK's own comments). Since
                      (    forth6809.asm):22483                                      ; RSTACK-(DSTACK+1)+1 simplifies to
                      (    forth6809.asm):22484                                      ; RSTACK-DSTACK (the +1/-1 cancel), the
