FF4E 39               (    forth6809.asm):22724                    RTS
                      (    forth6809.asm):22725         
FF4F CC0002           (    forth6809.asm):22726         TWOBODY:   LDD   #2
FF52 3606             (    forth6809.asm):22727                    PSHU  D
FF54 39               (    forth6809.asm):22728                    RTS
                      (    forth6809.asm):22729         
